ualties",{"children":[["$","th",null,{"scope":"row","children":"Confederate artillery casualties"}],["$","td",null,{"children":["Nearly 100 in the episode’s account",["$","small",null,{"style":{"display":"block"},"children":"The artillery exchange produced little effect on the Federal position and also exposed supporting Confederate infantry and horses to concentrated fire."}]]}]]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14"]}]]}],"$L15"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18",false,"$L19",false,"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}]]}]
